### Create Person
# @name createPerson
POST {{baseUrl}}/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ana",
  "lastName": "García",
  "documentNumber": "12345678",
  "sex": "female",
  "birthDate": "1990-05-15",
  "phone": "+52-555-1234567",
  "childrenCount": 1,
  "occupation": "Profesora"
}

###

### List all Persons
GET {{baseUrl}}/persons

###

### Get Person by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/persons/{{personId}}

###

### Update Person (PATCH — only send fields to change)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/persons/{{personId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+52-555-9999999",
  "occupation": "Directora"
}
